# How to Enable All Gradual rollout of features for Windows 11 24H2
1. Install Windows 11 24H2 Build 26100.4061 (KB5058411) or later.
2. Copy Windows 11 24H2 Build 26100.4061 Cumulative Features Enablement to a *.reg file and import.
https://github.com/SimonMacer/AnWave/blob/PowerShell.zh-TW/Windows%2011%2024H2%20Build%2026100.4061%20Cumulative%20Features%20Enablement
3. Copy Gradual rollout of features for Windows 11 24H2 (English) to a *.reg file and import.
https://github.com/SimonMacer/AnWave/blob/PowerShell.zh-TW/Gradual%20rollout%20of%20features%20for%20Windows%2011%2024H2%20(English)
4. You will now need to restart your computer, for the changes to take effect.

# [Phone Link] How to Enable Direct access to cross-device features from the Start menu.
1. Make sure to Update All your Apps from the Microsoft Store, by going to Updates & downloads.
2. You will now need to restart your computer, for the changes to take effect.

